      "toNode": "c510000000000009",
      "toSide": "top",
      "toEnd": "arrow",
      "label": "逆序对把已有顺序量化为 insertion sort 的额外移动"
    },
    {
      "id": "c5e0000000000006",
      "fromNode": "c510000000000006",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "c510000000000007",
      "toSide": "left",
      "toEnd": "arrow",
      "label": "提前停止变体必须分开报告最好与最坏情形"
    },
    {
      "id": "c5e0000000000007",
      "fromNode": "c510000000000006",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "c510000000000008",
      "toSide": "left",
      "toEnd": "arrow",
      "label": "selection sort 展示比较数与交换数可以不同阶"
    },
    {
      "id": "c5e0000000000008",
      "fromNode": "c510000000000006",
