      "toSide": "left",
      "toEnd": "arrow",
      "label": "insertion sort 的输入敏感成本必须连同逆序度量陈述"
    },
    {
      "id": "c5e0000000000009",
      "fromNode": "c510000000000006",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "c51000000000000b",
      "toSide": "top",
      "toEnd": "arrow",
      "label": "时间结论之外还要报告归并缓冲与递归栈"
    },
    {
      "id": "c5e000000000000a",
      "fromNode": "c51000000000000a",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "c51000000000000b",
      "toSide": "left",
      "toEnd": "arrow",
      "label": "线性归并给递归树每层提供 Θ(n) 工作"
    },
    {
